<span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: #670000\">&nbsp; - 국가근로(교외) 봉곡도서관은 주말에만 근무</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line06.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; POSITION: relative; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black; TOP: -999px; BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0px\"></div></span></span></span><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2019학년도 1학기&nbsp;학기 중 부서별 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기간 내에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">- 근로장학생 선발은 선착순이 아님을 알려드립니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">- 신청자 전체 명단이 신청기간 후에 각 부서에 일괄적으로 통보됩니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅰ. 국가 교육근로장학생</span></strong></span><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2019-1학기 재학생 중 한국장학재단 국가 교육근로장학사업&nbsp;신청자 중 순위 통과자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1) 1순위~3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2순위, 3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능하나, 1순위자가 근로배정인원보다 적은 경우 등 부득이한 경우 </span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2순위→3순위 순으로 근로선발 가능</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 순위 외 : 국가근로 선발순위 없음, 국가근로 신청불가</span></span>​<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※순위확인 방법 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국장학재단에서 확인</span></span></span> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span>신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능)<span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 소득 정보 확인 : 8분위 이하</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청기간 : 2019.2.13.(수) 10:00 ~ 2.18.(월) 18:00 까지</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 근로기간 : 2019.3.1.(월)~2019.6.23.(일) [학기 중]</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 부서 신청방법</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 온라인 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청 상세내역작성(계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 국가근로 선발기준: 소득순위&gt;시간표&gt;성적[현재 대학자체기준 미확정으로 변경될 수 있음]</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 근무부서, 희망근무장소 : 붙임 참고 (반드시 파일확인 후 신청하세요)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 희망근무시간(가능한 시간 모두 기재)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 시간 입력시 시간단위는 24시간으로 기재(오후 3시일 경우 → 15시로 입력)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 월:13:00~15:00/ 화:11:00~12:00, 15:00~17:00/ 수:14:00~18:00/ 목: 없음/ 금: 9:00~13:00</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 반드시 수업시간을 제외한 근로가능시간을 입력해야 함</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;마. 모두 입력 후 신청버튼 클릭~! 별도 제출서류 없음</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 선발일정</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[2019.2.13.(수) 10:00 ~ 2.18.(월) 18:00 까지]</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단을 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">학생처 : 근로장학생 선발확정(예정)&nbsp;[2019.2.26.(화)]</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 근로장학금액 : 근로 다음달 10일 지급(10일이 주말일 경우 금요일에 지급)</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 교내일반 :&nbsp;시간당 급여 8,350원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 교외일반 : 시간당 급여 10,500원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line05.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; POSITION: relative; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black; TOP: -999px; BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0px\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅱ. 대학근로장학생 </span></strong></span></span><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2019-1학기 재학생 중 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청기간 : 2019.2.13.(수) 10:00 ~ 2.18.(월) 18:00 까지</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 근로기간 : 2019.3.1.(월)~2019.6.23.(일) [학기 중]</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 대학근로 운영부